      "side": 1,
      "message": "Needn\u0027t disable ISR.\nWe swap from SRC to new SNK: when we tx or rx accept, we will assert Rd on cc. This will trigger plug out ISR and switch to detect plug in. After partner rx PS_RDY, the partner will assert Rp on cc. This will trigger plug in ISR and switch to disable detecting plug out. \n\nI found that TCPMv2 now get all cc state by polling instead of PD_EVENT_CC ISR. So if we make sure that TCPMv2 will not get cc state by ISR, then this CL will be abandoned.",
